      "domain": "energy",
      "entity_id": "energy.fuels.charcoal",
      "description": "Carbonization of hardwood in earth-covered pits or simple kilns at 300-600°C under limited oxygen. Primary fuel for all metallurgy until coke production is established. Yields 20-35% charcoal by weight.",
