      "domain": "machine-tools",
      "entity_id": "metals.casting",
      "description": "Green sand molding with bentonite binder, pattern making with shrinkage allowance, and flask-based casting of iron or aluminum. Every machine tool starts as a sand-cast iron or aluminum casting. Process covers pattern to finished casting.",
      "steps": [
