      "entity_id": "textiles.textiles",
      "description": "Conversion of natural or synthetic fibers into finished woven cloth through fiber preparation, spinning into yarn, weaving on a loom, and finishing treatments (washing, dyeing, calendering). The mechanization of these steps (spinning jenny, power loom) was the catalyst for the Industrial Revolution.",
      "steps": [
